\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Held-out mean per-cell deviance on gambles the fit never saw, averaged over 10 random 30/10 splits. The structural model beats the probability-only reduced form in every family and on every individual split, and the constant benchmark trails both. Phase 1's in-sample near-tie between the structural model and the probability-only logit does not survive out of sample.}}{17}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:holdout}{{6}{17}{Held-out mean per-cell deviance on gambles the fit never saw, averaged over 10 random 30/10 splits. The structural model beats the probability-only reduced form in every family and on every individual split, and the constant benchmark trails both. Phase 1's in-sample near-tie between the structural model and the probability-only logit does not survive out of sample}{figure.6}{}}
